OL,3,GNEWSARacer suffered injuries to skull
OL,4,Ain fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA competitor in the Manx Grand Prix
OL,7,Fdied from injuries to his skull after
OL,8,Fhis bike left the road at speed during
OL,9,Fqualifying, an inquest has heard.
OL,11,FElliot Sam Naughton, known as Sam, was
OL,12,Fkilled in the crash at Doran's Bend, on
OL,13,Fthe western section of the 37.7 mile
OL,14,F(61km) Mountain Course during the
OL,15,Fafternoon session on 19 August.
OL,17,FThe 37-year-old, from Castletown on the
OL,18,FIsle of Man, was competing in the Manx
OL,19,FGrand Prix (MGP) for the second time
OL,20,Fafter making his debut at the event in
OL,21,F2025.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
